# Verify {{ project_name }}

Run in order and stop at the first failure:

```shell
pnpm exec biome ci .
pnpm run typecheck
pnpm test
pnpm build
```

On failure: fix issues introduced by the current change, then rerun the failing command and everything after it. `pnpm run format` applies safe formatting, lint and import fixes automatically.

Report pre-existing or environment-related failures separately instead of working around them (no `biome-ignore`, `@ts-expect-error`, `any` or skipped tests without the user's agreement).
